'''Gekirinchi''' (ゲキリンチー) is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy appearing in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 8.7 Update|Version 8.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Gekirinchi
|image = E 462.png
|appearance = [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 750¢ - 2,962¢
}}

==Enemy==
Much more terrifying than its [[Yurinchi (Enemy)|greyscale counterpart]], sporting high health with moderate damage and range makes this enemy more threatening that it should be.

==Strategy==
Since this enemy it is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemy]], using units such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]], [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]] and anything that is above 340 range will deal with this enemy in no time.

